<title>USA: Advanced Mammography hires adviser.</title>
<headline>Advanced Mammography hires adviser.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Mass. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Mammography Systems Inc Friday said it retained InterFirst Capital, a Los Angeles-based investment banking firm, to provide strategic financial advice to the company.</p>
<p>Advanced Mammography is the developer of the only FDA approved, MRI-based dedicated breast imaging system, the Aurora. It retained InterFirst to provide advisory services to include such matters as financing strategies, development of strategic alliances, mergers and acquisitions and maximization of equity value.</p>
</text>
